# flutter_data_kit

- Core public API only via `lib/flutter_data_kit.dart`.
- Core must not depend on dio, supabase_flutter, firebase_*, or drift.
- Vendor exceptions stop at adapters; map to `AppFailure` (no message strings).
- Repositories throw `AppFailure`; do not return `Either<String, T>`.
- Use `fvm flutter` / `fvm dart` (pin 3.35.7). Never upgrade the shared SDK.
- Do not build input_kit / nav_kit / app_kit unless asked.
